    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/pixel-ebook-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Pixel Ebook Store theme is a sleek and modern solution designed for authors, publishers, bookstores, libraries, book clubs, comic shops, online bookshops, eBook retailers, and digital publishing platforms seeking a professional presence. Whether you run an independent bookstore, specialty shop, online library, digital reading platform, subscription-based book service, or audiobook store, this theme provides an intuitive and visually engaging platform to showcase and sell eBooks, audiobooks, bestsellers, limited editions, comics, magazines, academic publications, research papers, and novels. Ideal for self-published authors, audiobook creators, digital publishers, and book reviewers, it features customizable layouts, immersive reading previews, dynamic product showcases, advanced filtering, category-based organization, and wishlist options. With WooCommerce plugin integration, you can sell physical and digital books, offer book bundles, manage inventory, set up pre-orders, and provide subscription services effortlessly. This responsive, SEO-friendly, fast-loading, and translation-ready theme enhances engagement with social media integration, interactive showcases, author profiles, and promotional features for book signings, virtual book fairs, and literary events. Its built-in blogging capabilities are perfect for style guides, author spotlights, genre highlights, literary reviews, and reading recommendations, while multilingual support ensures global accessibility. Whether you manage a digital bookstore, academic library, literary café, or online reading community, Pixel Ebook Store combines elegant design, powerful eCommerce tools, and user-friendly navigation to deliver a professional, engaging, and feature-rich platform for readers and book sellers alike."
    },
